## ObjectType: Load Forecast

Local operational object; source concept reference does not assert OWL equivalence.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| forecast_id | Forecast id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | forecast_id |
| device_id | Device id | string | Explicit foreign-key association; blank creates no edge. | device_id |
| response_date | Response date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoffs. | response_date |
| block_code | Block code | string | Stable English code; paired display field is localized. | block_code |
| forecast_kw | Forecast kw | decimal | Decimal source value; blank is unknown, not zero. Power kW, energy kWh, money CNY; see business contract. | forecast_kw |
| quality | Quality | string | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | quality |
| quality_code | Quality code | string | Stable English code; paired display field is localized. | quality_code |
| revision | Revision | integer | Fictional business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. | revision |
| known_date | Known date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoffs. | known_date |

